8.14 run#theWindowDoesNotSelectThePreviousTicksRow — a window that is not a count of minutes is refused (tools/sensors/run.sh)
8.15 sensors#aRecordedConditionParsesToItsObject — the recorded condition parses to its object, not to the marker tail (tools/sensors/lib.sh)
